2a:["$","p","p-18",{"children":["这个地方，笔者觉得有一些问题， ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"state.swap(2, Acquire)"}]," 这一行代码会无条件将 ",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"state"}]," 置为 ",["$","code","code-2",{"className":"$undefined","children":"2"}],"，也就是说，当这个线程抢到锁后，它在 ",["$","code","code-3",{"className":"$undefined","children":"unlock()"}]," 的时候，无论有没有在阻塞的线程，这个时候 ",["$","code","code-4",{"className":"$undefined","children":"state"}]," 都是 ",["$","code","code-5",{"className":"$undefined","children":"2"}],"，所以都会调用 ",["$","code","code-6",{"className":"$undefined","children":"wake_one"}],"。"]}]
2b:["$","$L4e","pre-8,code-0",{"source":"sequenceDiagram\n    participant A as 线程A (持有锁)\n    participant B as 线程B (尝试获锁)\n    participant State as Mutex State\n    participant System as 系统调用\n\n    Note over State: state = 1 (线程A持有锁)\n\n    B->>State: compare_exchange(0, 1)\n    State-->>B: 失败 (返回 1)\n\n    Note over B: 进入 while 循环\n    B->>State: swap(2)\n    Note over State: state: 1 → 2\n    State-->>B: 返回 1 (≠ 0)\n\n    B->>System: wait(&state, 2)\n    Note over B: 线程B进入等待状态\n\n    Note over A: 线程A释放锁\n    A->>State: swap(0)\n    Note over State: state: 2 → 0\n    State-->>A: 返回 2\n\n    A->>System: wake_one()\n    Note over System: 正确的唤醒！线程B确实在等待\n\n    Note over B: 线程B被唤醒，继续循环\n    B->>State: swap(2)\n    Note over State: state: 0 → 2\n    State-->>B: 返回 0，退出循环\n\n    Note over B: 获得锁，但state=2 (问题所在)\n    Note over B: 使用锁...\n\n    B->>State: unlock() - swap(0)\n    Note over State: state: 2 → 0\n    State-->>B: 返回 2\n\n    B->>System: wake_one()\n    Note over System: 不必要的调用！此时没有等待者"}]
