30:["$","ol","ol-2",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":["我们获取 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"state.compare_exchange(0,1)"}]," 的返回值，如果成功，说明抢到锁，直接返回。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":["如果失败了：\n",["$","ul","ul-0",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":["原始值是 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"1"}],"，那我们就尝试将 ",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"state"}]," 从 ",["$","code","code-2",{"className":"$undefined","children":"1"}]," 交换为 ",["$","code","code-3",{"className":"$undefined","children":"2"}],"，然后调用 ",["$","code","code-4",{"className":"$undefined","children":"wait"}]," 陷入休眠。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":["原始值是 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"2"}],"，说明已经有别的线程也被阻塞了，这个时候直接调用 ",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"wait"}]," 陷入休眠。"]}],"\n"]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-2",{"children":["当被 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"wake_one"}]," 唤醒时，重新执行 ",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"state.compare_exchange(0,1)"}]," 抢占锁。"]}],"\n"]}]
31:["$","p","p-21",{"children":["这个新的流程中，我们抢到锁的时候，",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"state"}]," 会被正确的设置为 ",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"1"}]," 而不是 ",["$","code","code-2",{"className":"$undefined","children":"2"}],"，这个时候，在 ",["$","code","code-3",{"className":"$undefined","children":"drop"}]," 的时候就不会有不必要的 ",["$","code","code-4",{"className":"$undefined","children":"wake_one"}]," 的调用了。"]}]
32:["$","$L4e","pre-11,code-0",{"source":"sequenceDiagram\n    participant A as 线程A (持有锁)\n    participant B as 线程B (尝试获锁)\n    participant State as Mutex State\n    participant System as 系统调用\n\n    Note over State: state = 1 (线程A持有锁)\n\n    B->>State: compare_exchange(0, 1)\n    State-->>B: 失败，返回 s=1\n\n    Note over B: s == 1，尝试设置等待者标志\n    B->>State: compare_exchange(1, 2)\n    Note over State: state: 1 → 2\n    State-->>B: 成功\n\n    B->>System: wait(&state, 2)\n    Note over B: 线程B进入等待状态\n\n    Note over A: 线程A完成工作，释放锁\n    A->>State: unlock() - swap(0)\n    Note over State: state: 2 → 0\n    State-->>A: 返回 2\n\n    A->>System: wake_one()\n    Note over System: 正确唤醒线程B\n\n    Note over B: 线程B被唤醒，重新尝试获取锁\n    B->>State: compare_exchange(0, 1)\n    Note over State: state: 0 → 1 (关键！)\n    State-->>B: 成功！退出循环\n\n    Note over B: 🎯 获得锁，state=1 (正确状态)\n    Note over B: 使用锁进行工作...\n\n    B->>State: unlock() - swap(0)\n    Note over State: state: 1 → 0\n    State-->>B: 返回 1 (不是2！)\n\n    Note over B: ✅ 返回值是1，不调用wake_one\n    Note over System: 🎯 避免了不必要的系统调用"}]
